WEBVTT

00:00:45.546 --> 00:00:48.799
<i>Kokoro egakidasu</i>

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:52.386
<i>chizujou no michinaru frontier</i>

00:00:52.386 --> 00:00:55.806
<i>Tobira hiraitara</i>

00:00:55.806 --> 00:00:59.142
<i>michi wa tsuzuiteiru yo</i>

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:05.107
<i>Hokori makiagete kimi no machi e</i>

00:01:05.107 --> 00:01:11.822
<i>Sora to daichi ga kasanaru ruuto de</i>

00:01:11.822 --> 00:01:15.576
<i>Hashiru minamikaze ni notte</i>

00:01:15.576 --> 00:01:18.495
<i>Aoku somaru kaze wo kitte</i>

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:25.627
<i>Kokorogoto kakedashiteirun da</i>

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:29.131
<i>Mahiru no tsuki wo oikoshite</i>

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:32.259
<i>Kinou to wa chigau sekai e</i>

00:01:32.259 --> 00:01:37.681
<i>Dokomademo hashirinuketeku</i>

00:01:37.681 --> 00:01:41.602
<i>Ano kaze no you ni</i>

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:46.899
<i>Ano kaze no you ni</i>

00:01:58.702 --> 00:01:59.703
Caw!

00:01:59.703 --> 00:02:00.996
It's morning!

00:02:00.996 --> 00:02:01.997
"The Situation Beneath the Surface"
Caw!

00:02:01.997 --> 00:02:03.457
"The Situation Beneath the Surface"
Wake up!

00:02:03.457 --> 00:02:04.416
"The Situation Beneath the Surface"
Caw!

00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:06.960
Kana-<i>chan</i>, you'll be late!

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:07.711
Caw!

00:02:07.711 --> 00:02:08.962
It's morning!

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:10.172
Caw!

00:02:10.172 --> 00:02:11.298
Wake up!

00:02:37.533 --> 00:02:39.701
Oww...

00:02:46.875 --> 00:02:50.629
"Merida Island"

00:02:51.672 --> 00:02:53.507
Continuing on, take a look at this.

00:02:53.507 --> 00:02:57.261
This is from a certain operation
which Sergeant Sagara took part in.

00:02:57.261 --> 00:02:59.596
It's an AS unit which
we've fought with previously.

00:02:59.596 --> 00:03:02.766
Code name: Venom.

00:03:02.766 --> 00:03:05.936
What I want you to pay
particular attention to is this...

00:03:06.937 --> 00:03:08.981
As it emits this light,

00:03:08.981 --> 00:03:14.611
some sort of power renders all
attacks against it virtually useless.

00:03:14.611 --> 00:03:18.615
A device called the
Lambda Driver is involved in this.

00:03:18.615 --> 00:03:20.534
It's probably almost the same as

00:03:20.534 --> 00:03:23.620
what's installed on board
Sergeant Sagara's Arbalest.

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:24.746
Lieutenant Commander!

00:03:24.746 --> 00:03:26.790
What is it, Sergeant Weber?

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:29.585
What is the Lambda Driver?

00:03:29.585 --> 00:03:32.629
I will have the captain explain that for you.

00:03:32.629 --> 00:03:35.132
Captain?

00:03:35.132 --> 00:03:37.593
Because this is a classified matter,

00:03:37.593 --> 00:03:43.640
I have not given you a clear explanation before.
However, I would like to do so now.

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:45.809
The Lambda Driver is a device also known as

00:03:45.809 --> 00:03:49.605
a "Hidden-String Repulsion
Field Generation System."

00:03:50.647 --> 00:03:52.149
So, in other words...

00:03:52.149 --> 00:03:56.612
In plain terms, it is a device which
transforms the user's mental image

00:03:56.612 --> 00:03:57.905
directly into physical power.

00:03:57.905 --> 00:04:01.909
For example, it can deflect a bullet
or destroy a target.

00:04:01.909 --> 00:04:03.744
What the heck is that?

00:04:03.744 --> 00:04:06.830
Do you think that I'm joking?

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.290
Then I have a question!

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.334
Yes, Sergeant Major Mao?

00:04:10.334 --> 00:04:14.713
If it's that versatile and powerful,
how come Sousuke hardly ever uses it?

00:04:14.713 --> 00:04:19.301
I've never really seen Sousuke use it.

00:04:19.301 --> 00:04:22.095
In fact, that very thing
is one of the main factors

00:04:22.095 --> 00:04:25.682
which causes the effectiveness
of this device to be unstable.

00:04:25.682 --> 00:04:29.978
It reflects the user's will,
exactly as I mentioned before,

00:04:29.978 --> 00:04:34.858
however, using its power
requires tremendous focus.

00:04:34.858 --> 00:04:36.193
Focus?

00:04:36.193 --> 00:04:40.697
It is a kind of device which will
only activate in extreme situations,

00:04:40.697 --> 00:04:42.699
such as when life is at stake.

00:04:42.699 --> 00:04:46.703
So if things don't get to that level,
it ends in a misfire?

00:04:46.703 --> 00:04:48.622
Exactly.

00:04:48.622 --> 00:04:54.127
The enemies I fought before
seemed to have complete control of it.

00:04:54.127 --> 00:04:56.672
How can they do something like that?

00:04:56.672 --> 00:04:58.340
I cannot say for certain,

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:00.717
but they probably either had extreme training,

00:05:00.717 --> 00:05:07.307
or are using some kind of drug to artificially
induce that kind of mental state.

00:05:07.307 --> 00:05:08.642
Then...

00:05:08.642 --> 00:05:09.893
Yes, Corporal Yang?

00:05:09.893 --> 00:05:14.690
Are there any other machines besides the
Arbalest which have the Lambda Driver?

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:19.987
We would like to further research and develop
new technologies within Mithril as well,

00:05:19.987 --> 00:05:24.741
but the reality is, due to various
circumstances, there are no plans for it.

00:05:24.741 --> 00:05:28.078
So, in other words, you're saying that
only Sergeant Sagara can fight them?

00:05:28.078 --> 00:05:30.789
Not necessarily.

00:05:30.789 --> 00:05:34.376
However, if we do fight them
without Lambda Drivers,

00:05:34.376 --> 00:05:37.671
we should expect a large
number of casualties.

00:05:40.048 --> 00:05:41.717
No talking without permission.

00:05:41.717 --> 00:05:44.928
We are currently investigating
methods of countering the Lambda Driver.

00:05:44.928 --> 00:05:47.264
Once we receive a report, you will be informed.

00:05:47.264 --> 00:05:49.183
That is all. Dismissed.

00:05:51.852 --> 00:05:52.686
Captain.

00:05:52.686 --> 00:05:54.104
Yes, what is it?

00:05:54.104 --> 00:05:58.108
We have received this report from
Sergeant Sagara about Wraith.

00:05:58.108 --> 00:05:59.860
Again?

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:03.071
Understood. I suppose I'll look over it.

00:06:04.781 --> 00:06:07.075
<i>Bodyguard mission, huh?</i>

00:06:07.075 --> 00:06:09.953
<i>And now that we don't even know</i>
<i>who is targeting Miss Kaname,</i>

00:06:09.953 --> 00:06:12.873
<i>we might not be prepared enough</i>

00:06:12.873 --> 00:06:17.503
<i>with only Mr. Sagara and Wraith</i>
<i>protecting a Whispered like her...</i>

00:06:18.754 --> 00:06:22.174
<i>But there are only</i>
<i>so many people we can spare.</i>

00:06:22.174 --> 00:06:24.301
<i>Still, that doesn't mean we can let the enemy</i>

00:06:24.301 --> 00:06:28.388
<i>have any more of the knowledge of</i>
<i>Black Technology that the Whispered possess.</i>

00:06:29.306 --> 00:06:30.807
Whispered...

00:06:31.975 --> 00:06:37.147
<i>If only Miss Kaname and</i>
<i>I couldn't hear that voice...</i>

00:06:37.147 --> 00:06:41.568
<i>I wonder if we could have</i>
<i>lived our lives as normal girls...</i>

00:06:42.736 --> 00:06:44.029
Good morning, Kana-<i>chan</i>!

00:06:44.029 --> 00:06:45.405
Oh, good morning.

00:06:45.405 --> 00:06:47.366
Hey, take a look at this!

00:06:47.366 --> 00:06:49.993
I found this fun website yesterday!

00:06:49.993 --> 00:06:51.828
Let me see.

00:06:51.828 --> 00:06:52.996
Huh?

00:06:54.915 --> 00:06:55.958
Huh?

00:06:58.502 --> 00:07:01.839
My test data...

00:07:01.839 --> 00:07:04.800
I worked three hard days on that...

00:07:06.426 --> 00:07:08.470
I wonder what happened?

00:07:13.851 --> 00:07:15.894
You say there's something on the roof?

00:07:15.894 --> 00:07:16.770
Oh, you're right!

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:17.855
It's huge!

00:07:17.855 --> 00:07:20.566
What is it?

00:07:20.566 --> 00:07:21.567
Geh!

00:07:23.527 --> 00:07:24.486
Ah, Kana-<i>chan</i>!

00:07:27.865 --> 00:07:30.200
Oh, Chidori! Take a look at this radar.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.118
Now we have good air def...

00:07:32.327 --> 00:07:34.246
Turn it off, right now!

00:07:34.246 --> 00:07:36.874
What was that for? That hurt, you know.

00:07:38.917 --> 00:07:40.419
"Do Not Use"
"Jindai High School Student Council"

00:07:40.419 --> 00:07:41.044
Honestly!

00:07:41.044 --> 00:07:42.963
He just never makes any progress!

00:07:42.963 --> 00:07:47.050
Now, now, Sagara realizes
what he did was wrong...

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:48.427
Sagara.

00:07:48.427 --> 00:07:49.428
What is it, Kazama?

00:07:49.428 --> 00:07:53.348
Sorry to bother you at a time like this,
but could you take a look at this?

00:07:53.348 --> 00:07:54.850
"Totally Crush-Worthy High School Girls Forum:
The 100 Day War of the Teacher on Night Watch"

00:07:55.934 --> 00:07:57.895
It's some forum.

00:07:57.895 --> 00:07:59.479
Those pictures have been up since last night.

00:07:59.479 --> 00:08:01.481
I don't know how they took them, but...

00:08:01.481 --> 00:08:03.400
Oh no. This is bad.

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:05.402
It's like revealing her to the enemy.

00:08:05.402 --> 00:08:07.905
We should find the culprit fast and stop him...

00:08:07.905 --> 00:08:09.072
Hey! Sagara!

00:08:10.073 --> 00:08:10.866
What do you want?

00:08:10.866 --> 00:08:13.243
It... It's nothing. Don't worry about it.

00:08:13.243 --> 00:08:14.995
What's wrong, Kazama?

00:08:14.995 --> 00:08:17.331
I don't think you should tell the victim.

00:08:17.331 --> 00:08:18.874
I'm sure it would hurt her.

00:08:18.874 --> 00:08:19.875
Is that so?

00:08:19.875 --> 00:08:21.043
That's the normal reaction.

00:08:21.043 --> 00:08:22.920
--So we have to somehow do it without her finding out that...
--What's going on?

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:24.963
What have you two been
whispering about over here?

00:08:24.963 --> 00:08:26.965
N-N-N-Nothing at all!

00:08:26.965 --> 00:08:31.220
Carry on enjoying your usual
high school life to your heart's content!

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:33.639
That was blatantly awkward...

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:44.608
"Hong Kong"

00:08:48.111 --> 00:08:51.949
Big Sis, how is Sensei doing?

00:08:51.949 --> 00:08:54.117
He's stabilized a little.

00:08:54.117 --> 00:08:56.370
The medicine seems to have started working.

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:57.621
Yes.

00:09:00.916 --> 00:09:02.459
Oh yeah...

00:09:02.459 --> 00:09:03.877
What is it?

00:09:03.877 --> 00:09:07.005
We've run out of bandages.

00:09:07.005 --> 00:09:09.091
We'll have to go buy some later.

00:09:09.091 --> 00:09:10.968
I will go.

00:09:10.968 --> 00:09:12.636
I see.

00:09:12.636 --> 00:09:16.431
In that case, I will wipe down Sensei's body.

00:09:25.148 --> 00:09:29.236
I wonder how much longer
Sensei is going to live.

00:09:32.239 --> 00:09:36.034
But Sis...

00:09:36.034 --> 00:09:39.037
I'm happy.

00:09:39.037 --> 00:09:40.455
About what?

00:09:40.455 --> 00:09:45.586
That we could see Sensei again.

00:09:45.586 --> 00:09:47.337
I see.

00:09:47.337 --> 00:09:49.006
You're right.

00:09:59.558 --> 00:10:00.642
It's a job.

00:10:04.479 --> 00:10:07.107
I hate that man.

00:10:07.107 --> 00:10:10.360
Bear with it.

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:11.361
Let's go.

00:10:24.082 --> 00:10:24.958
What is up with him?

00:10:24.958 --> 00:10:26.460
Miss Chidori.

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:29.004
Here's the CD you said
you wanted to check out before.

00:10:31.089 --> 00:10:32.674
What the heck are you doing, Sousuke?!

00:10:34.176 --> 00:10:35.719
Okay, no problem.

00:10:35.719 --> 00:10:37.054
There's a<i> big </i>problem!

00:10:38.972 --> 00:10:41.391
Oh, Chidori. About that report the other day...

00:10:42.643 --> 00:10:44.061
Don't struggle!

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:47.648
No problem.

00:10:47.648 --> 00:10:49.107
No, there's a<i> big </i>problem!

00:10:50.067 --> 00:10:53.737
So, you're dead set on following me in there?

00:10:53.737 --> 00:10:54.571
Is that not possible?

00:10:54.571 --> 00:10:56.114
Of course not!

00:10:56.114 --> 00:10:59.243
Why the hell should I have to have you
wait for me in front of the toilet stall?

00:10:59.243 --> 00:11:01.161
--There's no problem with that, is there?
--There are plenty of problems with that!

00:11:03.288 --> 00:11:04.623
In that case,

00:11:04.623 --> 00:11:08.001
at least let me conduct a thorough
inspection of the stall before and after you...

00:11:10.045 --> 00:11:12.172
You pervert!

00:11:12.172 --> 00:11:15.092
--Take this! And this! And this! And this! And this!
--Kana-<i>chan</i>, calm down!

00:11:15.092 --> 00:11:16.260
Take this! And this!

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:17.219
"Girls Locker Room"

00:11:17.219 --> 00:11:20.138
Sagara's acting a little strange today, isn't he

00:11:20.138 --> 00:11:23.183
I can't stand it when he
hangs all over me like that.

00:11:23.183 --> 00:11:25.727
But it's kind of similar, don't you think?

00:11:25.727 --> 00:11:26.728
What is?

00:11:26.728 --> 00:11:29.106
The way Sagara's been.

00:11:29.106 --> 00:11:31.692
It's like how he used to act
when he first got here, isn't it?

00:11:31.692 --> 00:11:32.693
Really?

00:11:32.693 --> 00:11:35.195
Hey, what do you think you're doing?

00:11:35.195 --> 00:11:36.196
What's wrong?

00:11:36.196 --> 00:11:38.615
Don't give me that!
What the heck are you doing in here?

00:11:38.615 --> 00:11:40.325
--An investigation.
--Of<i> what</i>?

00:11:40.325 --> 00:11:42.035
--Stop it right no...
--Stay still!

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:47.249
So it's up there.

00:11:47.249 --> 00:11:49.293
Wait, what do you mean?

00:11:49.293 --> 00:11:50.752
Cut it out!

00:11:52.129 --> 00:11:54.381
Jeez! Don't break it!

00:11:59.219 --> 00:12:02.139
No! My computer!

00:12:02.139 --> 00:12:06.059
For crying out loud! Why does it
always have to end up like this?!

00:12:18.197 --> 00:12:22.034
So that's the equipment they left behind, huh?

00:12:23.202 --> 00:12:25.120
Must be Mithril.

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:26.371
No, not necessar-

00:12:26.371 --> 00:12:27.789
Head south.

00:12:32.878 --> 00:12:36.840
Those footprints are from M9 models.
Most likely three of them.

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:39.092
There is no solid proof of that.

00:12:39.092 --> 00:12:41.303
It looks like they paradropped in,
then destroyed all hostile targets,

00:12:41.303 --> 00:12:44.556
and avoided the anti-air
artillery as they pulled out.

00:12:44.556 --> 00:12:46.683
Perhaps they changed their rendezvous point?

00:12:46.683 --> 00:12:49.228
One of them separated from its troop.

00:12:49.228 --> 00:12:51.563
It headed for...

00:12:51.563 --> 00:12:53.857
Most likely the anti-air formation, I guess.

00:12:53.857 --> 00:12:55.859
We cannot confirm that from here.

00:12:57.778 --> 00:13:01.865
It deflected a direct hit from a tank.

00:13:01.865 --> 00:13:05.160
That would be impossible
without a Lambda Driver.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.538
I would hesitate to draw that
conclusion from this evidence alone.

00:13:07.538 --> 00:13:10.457
There's no doubt about it. It's that white AS.

00:13:12.251 --> 00:13:14.211
Color is easy to change.

00:13:14.211 --> 00:13:17.548
Now the white AS breaks
through the defense and runs away!

00:13:17.548 --> 00:13:18.841
Look at him run!

00:13:18.841 --> 00:13:21.718
Oh no! Here comes enemy fire!

00:13:21.718 --> 00:13:24.221
So, what do you think,
commentator Dazz?

00:13:24.221 --> 00:13:25.222
Huh?

00:13:25.222 --> 00:13:27.808
Oh my! He threw down his weapon!
Is he out of ammo?

00:13:27.808 --> 00:13:30.519
And just as he reaches the bridge,
there's a pincer attack waiting for him!

00:13:30.519 --> 00:13:31.562
He's in trouble now!

00:13:31.562 --> 00:13:35.524
Oh! Can you believe it?
He turns toward the river and dives!

00:13:38.777 --> 00:13:42.155
Well, I suppose it went something like that.

00:13:42.155 --> 00:13:45.158
I guess I'll go meet the client now.

00:13:45.158 --> 00:13:48.245
Make sure you never let this happen again!

00:13:48.245 --> 00:13:49.413
Do I make myself clear?

00:13:49.413 --> 00:13:51.248
Understood!

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:56.253
How did it go?

00:13:56.253 --> 00:13:59.798
Listen, Sousuke.
What is wrong with you today?

00:13:59.798 --> 00:14:02.426
No matter how I look at it,
you're acting a little too strange.

00:14:02.426 --> 00:14:04.303
No! It's nothing.

00:14:04.303 --> 00:14:06.305
It's all in your mind.

00:14:11.226 --> 00:14:13.770
Jeez, if you don't want to tell me, then fine.

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:15.606
Miss Chidori!

00:14:15.606 --> 00:14:18.233
Well... Actually...

00:14:21.445 --> 00:14:24.281
Did you just say you're not going to pay?

00:14:24.281 --> 00:14:25.574
That's right!

00:14:25.574 --> 00:14:30.621
Your so-called "high-tech" weaponry
wasn't even one bit useful!

00:14:30.621 --> 00:14:32.497
I don't owe you anything for it!

00:14:34.208 --> 00:14:35.667
Now get outta here.

00:14:38.962 --> 00:14:42.549
Didn't your mommy ever tell you?

00:14:42.549 --> 00:14:44.301
"If you ever meet a scary man,

00:14:44.301 --> 00:14:48.388
protect your wallet
and your ass no matter what."

00:14:48.388 --> 00:14:50.474
What are you trying to say?

00:14:50.474 --> 00:14:52.726
Oh, nothing.

00:14:52.726 --> 00:14:54.603
It doesn't really mean anything.

00:14:57.981 --> 00:14:58.982
You bastard!

00:15:01.318 --> 00:15:02.236
Kill them.

00:15:14.331 --> 00:15:23.632
Ave Maria...

00:15:26.343 --> 00:15:28.428
What the hell is this?!

00:15:28.428 --> 00:15:30.514
Sneak photography, I think.

00:15:30.514 --> 00:15:36.687
I suggested to Sagara that we find the culprit
before you realized what was going on,

00:15:36.687 --> 00:15:39.314
but I kinda just couldn't
stand to watch anymore...

00:15:39.314 --> 00:15:40.440
<i>Unforgivable</i>!

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:43.360
Whoever did this will receive God's wrath!
God's wrath, I tell you!

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:45.404
Actually, we haven't found the cul-

00:15:45.404 --> 00:15:46.613
You haven't found him?!

00:15:46.613 --> 00:15:48.365
No, but I do have a clue.

00:15:48.365 --> 00:15:49.491
Take a look at this.

00:15:49.491 --> 00:15:50.701
What is it?

00:15:50.701 --> 00:15:52.369
A device used for sneaking pictures.

00:15:52.369 --> 00:15:54.329
I found it in the locker room ceiling.

00:15:54.329 --> 00:15:56.456
So that "investigation" you were doing...

00:15:56.456 --> 00:15:57.875
was to find this.

00:15:57.875 --> 00:16:00.460
I've already pinpointed its frequency.

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:03.380
So all we need to do is trace it,
and we'll have the culprit.

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:04.715
Sousuke, you're so smart!

00:16:04.715 --> 00:16:06.341
Let's get started.

00:16:09.928 --> 00:16:11.346
--Got it.
--That was fast!

00:16:11.346 --> 00:16:14.349
Bearing 0-9-0. Distance, 5 meters.

00:16:14.349 --> 00:16:15.392
So you mean...

00:16:15.392 --> 00:16:16.476
It's the classroom next door.

00:16:16.476 --> 00:16:17.394
All right, charge!

00:16:20.981 --> 00:16:21.899
So you're the one.

00:16:21.899 --> 00:16:22.733
Drop your weapon!

00:16:22.733 --> 00:16:24.484
Get down on the ground
with your arms and legs spr-

00:16:24.484 --> 00:16:27.070
Are you an idiot? Think about using
some moderation once in a while!

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:29.781
But this was the most effective
method of charging into the other-

00:16:29.781 --> 00:16:32.910
But that doesn't mean you had
to blow a hole in the school wall!

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:36.580
--The culprit got away...
--Geh!

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:37.372
We're going after him!

00:16:37.372 --> 00:16:45.923
Ave Maria...

00:16:54.765 --> 00:16:57.059
What's this?

00:16:57.059 --> 00:16:59.102
They're all dead?

00:16:59.102 --> 00:17:02.397
How the hell are we supposed to
collect the rest of the money now?

00:17:02.397 --> 00:17:03.732
But didn't you order us to...

00:17:06.610 --> 00:17:08.111
Don't give me that bullshit!

00:17:08.111 --> 00:17:11.114
Mommy always says not to
blame other people, doesn't she?

00:17:11.114 --> 00:17:14.409
Hello?! Hello?! Can you hear me?!

00:17:15.536 --> 00:17:19.665
Oh dear... he's dead. Another person died!

00:17:19.665 --> 00:17:23.460
Oh, what is this world coming to?

00:17:23.460 --> 00:17:27.005
It's filled with cruel deaths!

00:17:27.005 --> 00:17:30.133
Oh, I'm sad. So very sad.

00:17:30.133 --> 00:17:32.010
How stupid.

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:33.512
What?!

00:17:34.847 --> 00:17:37.391
Don't come any closer!

00:17:37.391 --> 00:17:42.145
Don't come any closer!
Take a look at<i> this </i>first!

00:17:42.145 --> 00:17:44.147
<i>No</i>!

00:17:45.524 --> 00:17:46.817
If you come any closer,

00:17:46.817 --> 00:17:50.195
I'll distribute this embarrassing picture
throughout the whole world!

00:17:50.195 --> 00:17:52.948
How evil and senseless!

00:17:52.948 --> 00:17:54.908
I don't think you're in a position to
talk about senselessness, though.

00:17:54.908 --> 00:17:57.828
You got that? You got that?
Now scram!

00:17:57.828 --> 00:18:00.247
Wow, he's the lowest kind of man, isn't he?

00:18:00.247 --> 00:18:01.582
Shut up!

00:18:01.582 --> 00:18:04.418
This is my revenge, got it?

00:18:04.418 --> 00:18:05.419
Revenge?

00:18:05.419 --> 00:18:06.420
That's right!

00:18:06.420 --> 00:18:10.007
I'll never forget how I lost to you
in the Student Council elections!

00:18:10.007 --> 00:18:12.176
You were in the elections?

00:18:12.176 --> 00:18:13.510
Anyway!

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:17.848
I'm going to spread this all over the world,
and ruin your reputation!

00:18:17.848 --> 00:18:21.226
You shall know my hatred and agony!

00:18:21.226 --> 00:18:23.020
Seems more like plain
undue resentment to me.

00:18:23.020 --> 00:18:25.814
Stop being so foolish. Calm down.

00:18:27.649 --> 00:18:30.485
I told you not to come any closer, didn't I?
I'll press the button, I swear!

00:18:30.485 --> 00:18:31.945
Stop!

00:18:31.945 --> 00:18:32.946
Very well.
I will shoot him down.

00:18:32.946 --> 00:18:33.780
Yeah! Do it!

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:34.907
No, wait, don't!

00:18:34.907 --> 00:18:38.869
I'll push it!
I swear I'll push it!

00:18:38.869 --> 00:18:40.537
--Chidori.
--What?

00:18:40.537 --> 00:18:43.582
All we have to do is make sure
he can't transmit that picture, correct?

00:18:43.582 --> 00:18:44.583
Yeah!

00:18:44.583 --> 00:18:46.543
Then that makes it simple!

00:19:01.725 --> 00:19:03.602
You're kidding...

00:19:03.602 --> 00:19:06.480
<i>No</i>!

00:19:11.527 --> 00:19:17.658
So, was it this mouth that said those things?

00:19:17.658 --> 00:19:21.078
Huh? Was it?

00:19:21.078 --> 00:19:27.000
You mustn't say such things.
I'll give you a spanking!

00:19:30.963 --> 00:19:32.840
You're no fun.

00:19:34.174 --> 00:19:37.678
We're leaving. Start preparations.

00:19:39.054 --> 00:19:42.766
Oh yeah, I just remembered.

00:19:42.766 --> 00:19:47.062
I heard your Sensei got turned into fish food.

00:19:47.062 --> 00:19:49.565
My condolences.

00:19:51.608 --> 00:19:59.157
Schlafe mein prinzchen, schlafe ein...

00:20:06.623 --> 00:20:08.125
Hello?

00:20:08.125 --> 00:20:11.253
Hi. It's been a while.

00:20:11.253 --> 00:20:14.590
It's rare to get a call from you.

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:15.591
What do you want?

00:20:16.633 --> 00:20:20.971
I heard that you two
had picked up your Sensei.

00:20:20.971 --> 00:20:23.557
News reaches you quickly, doesn't it?

00:20:23.557 --> 00:20:29.813
Personally, I would like you two
to keep a low profile, if possible.

00:20:29.813 --> 00:20:32.316
Is that a warning?

00:20:32.316 --> 00:20:35.819
Yes, I intend it to be one.

00:20:35.819 --> 00:20:40.866
Don't worry. We don't
plan on causing any trouble.

00:20:40.866 --> 00:20:43.327
Can I trust you?

00:20:43.327 --> 00:20:44.661
Of course.

00:20:45.662 --> 00:20:49.666
--Please forgive me! I'm sorry! Let me go!
--Then tell me the truth!

00:20:49.666 --> 00:20:51.835
What were your real intentions
in following Chidori around?

00:20:51.835 --> 00:20:54.129
It's like I just told you!

00:20:54.129 --> 00:20:56.590
So you insist on feigning innocence?

00:20:56.590 --> 00:20:58.592
Then I'll ask your body!

00:20:59.801 --> 00:21:02.012
I'll start with a finger.

00:21:02.012 --> 00:21:03.013
Which one should it be?

00:21:03.013 --> 00:21:04.765
Stop!

00:21:04.765 --> 00:21:06.975
All right, all right, that's enough.

00:21:06.975 --> 00:21:08.268
Why are you stopping me?

00:21:08.268 --> 00:21:11.730
Isn't it obvious?
He's just a normal high school kid.

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:12.940
Oh yeah.

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:14.858
There was someone peeping
into my apartment this morning.

00:21:14.858 --> 00:21:15.859
Was that you, too?

00:21:15.859 --> 00:21:16.693
Bastard!

00:21:16.693 --> 00:21:18.195
I don't know anything about that!

00:21:18.195 --> 00:21:20.781
The only pictures I took were in school!

00:21:20.781 --> 00:21:21.782
Really?

00:21:21.782 --> 00:21:23.784
It's the truth, honest!

00:21:23.784 --> 00:21:25.744
You're a very good actor.

00:21:25.744 --> 00:21:26.745
But that won't fool...

00:21:26.745 --> 00:21:28.497
Stop!

00:21:28.497 --> 00:21:30.624
--Wait!
--That's enough already.

00:21:30.624 --> 00:21:32.000
But I wasn't through questioning him...

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:35.045
That was plenty.

00:21:35.045 --> 00:21:37.130
But...

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:40.884
I wonder what in the
world that was this morning.

00:21:43.303 --> 00:21:46.181
Wow, this radar is really powerful!

00:21:46.181 --> 00:21:49.059
Aww, now I have to buy another cell phone.

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:13.250
Ugh, I gotta take a dump.

00:22:27.764 --> 00:22:33.312
<i>Kitto kimi wa kyou no hi mo</i>

00:22:33.312 --> 00:22:39.193
<i>Massugu ashita wo miteru</i>

00:22:39.193 --> 00:22:44.907
<i>Kaze ga fuku ano oka ni saita</i>

00:22:44.907 --> 00:22:51.663
<i>himawari no you ni</i>

00:22:53.582 --> 00:22:59.505
<i>Donna ni tooku hanareteite mo</i>

00:22:59.505 --> 00:23:05.511
<i>Kono utagoe ga kimi ni todoku you ni</i>

00:23:05.511 --> 00:23:11.558
<i>Namida ga zutto tomaranai yoru</i>

00:23:11.558 --> 00:23:17.898
<i>Kimi no mado wo terasu tsuki ni naritai</i>

00:23:17.898 --> 00:23:25.948
<i>Mata kanarazu aeru to</i>

00:23:28.283 --> 00:23:31.870
<i>Sou omou kara</i>

00:23:45.175 --> 00:23:45.843
"Next Episode"

00:23:45.843 --> 00:23:47.803
<i>An enemy whose actions</i>
<i>seem somehow suspicious.</i>

00:23:47.803 --> 00:23:49.763
<i>An isolated underground battlefield.</i>

00:23:49.763 --> 00:23:52.808
<i>And my lack of trust in the machine</i>
<i>I should look upon as my own.</i>

00:23:52.808 --> 00:23:56.144
<i>But even still, it wasn't a difficult mission.</i>

00:23:56.144 --> 00:23:58.522
<i>Next time: "The Labyrinth and the Dragon."</i>

00:23:58.522 --> 00:24:04.715
<i>A deep, complex spider web</i>
<i>entangles us further and further.</i>
